{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21910","headline":"三月三十日程氏馆饯杜十四归京 · 元稹","name":"三月三十日程氏馆饯杜十四归京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江春今日尽，程馆祖筵开。\n我正南冠絷，君寻北路回。\n谋身诚太拙，从宦苦无媒。\n处困方明命，遭时不在才。\n踰年长倚玉，连夜共衔杯。\n涸溜沾濡沫，余光照死灰。\n行看鸿欲翥，敢惮酒相催。\n拍逐飞觥绝，香随舞袖来。\n消棃抛五徧，娑葛𣩄三台\n已许尊前倒，临风泪莫颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}